author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Missing or non-finite task ceilings fail closed; missing or non-finite composite ceilings fail closed; focused negative controls and the real transcript gate pass; exact coverage and static gates pass
parent: pm-8pnj
resolution: Added finite-value guards and three-value negative controls for task and composite token ceilings.
expected_result: Every task and composite baseline contains a finite enforceable token ceiling.
actual_result: "Baseline comparison now refuses absent, NaN, and infinite task or composite ceilings with stable missing_baseline_limit findings."
